{
  "contract_name": "admin-risk-assessment",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "revision_note": "2026-10-12 (PM decision, Sprint 1 INT-05): new contract for the live assessment trigger. Calls ml-swdi-inference v1.1, scores with calculateRiskScore (40/20/15/25/30, flag at >= 70) and, when flagged, transitions ACTIVE_COMPLIANT -> FLAGGED_FOR_REVIEW with a MODEL_FLAG_RAISED audit block. Unflagged results are returned but not persisted.",
